\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Main results (accuracy \%) at the deployment sampler ($\gamma 56$@64; $\gamma 28$@32 on Sudoku) and at the cheap 64-step ODE sampler. RL rows are means over three seeds of the per-seed peak over evaluated checkpoints, every seed counted (per-seed values in Appendices~\ref {app:details} and~\ref {app:results}); bold marks the best of the three RL levels in a column, both when they are within evaluation jitter; ``--'' marks a run in progress. Scalar critic: $3{\times }10^{-6}\!\to \!10^{-6}$ schedule (on Sudoku every seed peaks at 125--250 iterations, below the base, and collapses by 500); 2D critic: $10^{-6}$. Loop rows start from an RL policy of each task (the scalar-critic policy on Countdown and Game24, a 2D-critic policy on Sudoku and K\&K). LLaDA rows: d1's recipe, 256 tokens (Appendix~\ref {app:d1}).}}{7}{table.caption.16}\protected@file@percent }
